     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking for accommodation",
     "texto": [
      "**Έχω κράτηση** means I have a reservation. **Θα ήθελα ένα δωμάτιο** means I would like a room.",
      "**Θα πάω** means I'll go / I'm going to go; **θέλω να πάω** means I want to go. To ask about a room, you can say **Έχετε δωμάτιο;** (do you have a room?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
